Z||000000||GT Bastard||07-01-2000||03:29 PM||||1FST2M6 and I met today and made the swap.  We took a couple joy-rides and I think we were both pleased.  The only downside was that we only had a couple hours to talk and we were both very exhausted from a lack of sleep.  I had to be going to work, and he had a long trip ahead of him.  Seemed like a really cool guy.  If anyone decides to do business with him in the future, he's awesome!  In case you haven't been following, I traded my '87 GT for his '86 SE.  Pics to follow.... <P>later all,<BR>Jeff||||reg||1
